cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these transcriptions, deep reads or the ledger, cite the repository and the release you used."
title: "Project Lighthouse: AI-assisted reading of unread scientific manuscripts"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Project Lighthouse contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/professorsolderin/project-lighthouse"
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
date-released: "2026-11-09"
abstract: >
  Page-level transcriptions and AI deep reads of digitized manuscripts (Gauss, Riemann, Hilbert, Dedekind,
  Grothendieck), a ledger of every candidate finding with its verification status, verification scripts,
  and the pipeline that produced them. Priority for any finding is the date of the commit or release that
  first contains its ledger entry.
